      "name": "Fossil Corner",
      "steam_appid": 1587710,
      "required_age": 0,
      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fossil Corner, you're a retired paleontologist, collecting fossils and solving evolutionary puzzles in your old garage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your dream fossil collection! Countless species are possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve chill, tactile, procedurally generated puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your room &amp; display your fossils any way you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retirement hasn't been easy. Use your old computer to email your friends. Maybe that'll help</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stare out the window. Watch the leaves blow by and hear the sounds of fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features an original soundtrack by Dylan Payne &amp; Bobby Volpendesta!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT FOSSILS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect randomly generated fossil shells, trilobites, and crinoids. Countless species are possible! Share with your friends with your fossils' <i>Species Code</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587710/extras/3de3e697d8fed6df9f7a85c11ea600e1.avif?t=1765570169\" width=600 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is a box of procedurally generated fossils that form a complete family tree. Unscramble the family trees by looking at how the species changed over generations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587710/extras/b4802a44474d0ab0303fcd52993dcb1e.poster.avif?t=1765570169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587710/extras/b4802a44474d0ab0303fcd52993dcb1e.webm?t=1765570169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587710/extras/b4802a44474d0ab0303fcd52993dcb1e.mp4?t=1765570169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fossil Corner, you're a retired paleontologist, collecting fossils and solving evolutionary puzzles in your old garage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your dream fossil collection! Countless species are possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve chill, tactile, procedurally generated puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your room &amp; display your fossils any way you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retirement hasn't been easy. Use your old computer to email your friends. Maybe that'll help</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stare out the window. Watch the leaves blow by and hear the sounds of fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features an original soundtrack by Dylan Payne &amp; Bobby Volpendesta!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT FOSSILS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect randomly generated fossil shells, trilobites, and crinoids. Countless species are possible! Share with your friends with your fossils' <i>Species Code</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587710/extras/3de3e697d8fed6df9f7a85c11ea600e1.avif?t=1765570169\" width=600 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is a box of procedurally generated fossils that form a complete family tree. Unscramble the family trees by looking at how the species changed over generations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587710/extras/b4802a44474d0ab0303fcd52993dcb1e.poster.avif?t=1765570169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587710/extras/b4802a44474d0ab0303fcd52993dcb1e.webm?t=1765570169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587710/extras/b4802a44474d0ab0303fcd52993dcb1e.mp4?t=1765570169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
      "short_description": "You're a retired paleontologist. Collect fossils and solve puzzles in the calm of your old garage!",
      "supported_languages": "English",
      "reviews": "“Honestly, I wish I could retire to become a full-time player of Fossil Corner.”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>“You get a sense that this is your space and these are your fossils… there's great pleasure in gradually bringing the barren walls you're presented with to life.”<br>Eurogamer<br>",
